## About the standard

Open control catalogue for protecting controlled unclassified information (CUI) in non-federal systems.

The control and requirement statements below are reproduced in English from the publisher’s open data.

Official source: [NIST SP 800-171 Rev. 3](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/171/r3/final).

